{"id":"n16458-1-10","stage":5,"title":"상당 · 相当于","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16458-1-10-1","ko":"대회에 참여하면 어떤 혜택이 있나요?","zh":"参加比赛有什么福利？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"대회에","meaning":"比赛，大赛","explanation":"대회：比赛，大赛；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"대회","audio":"/audio/7255709b1fec18f41a20.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61306","senseId":"2","lemma":"대회","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대회에","audio":"/audio/63c69605f8e9014f3f85.mp3"}},{"text":"참여하면","meaning":"参与，出席","explanation":"참여하다：参与，出席；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"참여하다","audio":"/audio/9e39b706c0f79a35cd7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24871","senseId":"1","lemma":"참여하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참여하면","audio":"/audio/fcbc1d102624b8bbcc49.mp3"}},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"什么样的，怎么样的","explanation":"어떤：什么样的，怎么样的","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}},{"text":"혜택이","meaning":"惠泽，恩泽，恩惠，优惠，实惠","explanation":"혜택：惠泽，恩泽，恩惠，优惠，实惠；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"혜택","audio":"/audio/0eab7119e8843522806b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86397","senseId":"1","lemma":"혜택","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"혜택이","audio":"/audio/a4c59d1436a66ac717b9.mp3"}},{"text":"있나요?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있나요","audio":"/audio/0eb260e471116d837abb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7255709b1fec18f4","term":"대회","zh":"比赛，大赛","audio":"/audio/7255709b1fec18f41a20.mp3","entryId":"61306","definition":"许多人较量实力或技术的活动。","pronunciation":["대ː회"